    "updated_at": "2016-01-27T07:39:35Z",
    "body": "Apparently cool URLs _do_ change, this is the latest available for the xforms URL:\nhttp://web.archive.org/web/20071028101023/http://www.w3.org/TR/xforms/slice8.html\n\nUnfortunately, both that, https://www.w3.org/Consortium/#membership and https://www.w3.org/TR/XForms/ appear in an example with a screenshot. Since you can't actually click to follow those links, I'll leave them alone.\n\nhttp://www.w3.org/TR/2004/WD-SVG12-20041027/ is oddly 403 even though it's currently linked from https://www.w3.org/TR/SVG12/\nIt's used in the same `hgroup` example as https://www.w3.org/Consortium/Legal/ipr-notic (missing an 'e') so perhaps it's best to just rewrite that example.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
